{"about_the_game":"Building on the best aspects of UnderMine, an acclaimed action-adventure roguelike, UnderMine 2 takes dungeon crawling to a whole new level! Discover, combine, craft, and transmute powerful relics and take your lowly peasant from zero to hero. Trivial human politics distract as cosmic machinations unfold \u2014 there is more than one war in Delvemore. While King Faraam IV attempts to regain control of his kingdom, the unseen war between two daemonic siblings ripples the fabric of reality. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869780/extras/7d6f8f1026471ded4f63ceef6b84258c.poster.avif?t=1753197806\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869780/extras/7d6f8f1026471ded4f63ceef6b84258c.webm?t=1753197806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869780/extras/7d6f8f1026471ded4f63ceef6b84258c.mp4?t=1753197806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH A FRIEND</h2>Invite your friend to drop in and play through the entirety of UnderMine 2 together! Two-player co-op lets you tackle the game with each other, presenting a dynamic challenge and opening up new strategic options.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAYABLE CHARACTERS</h2>Discover, unlock, and play as new characters, including Black Rabbit, a lucky and ambitious treasure hunter. Each character has unique stats, abilities, upgrades, and relics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRANCHING PATHS</h2>New regions of the Undermine have been revealed, and each branches off into various other areas. Navigate it to complete builds, quests, and different objectives. Your final challenge depends entirely on your decisions throughout the run.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARCANA</h2>Wield new, interactive relics called Arcana. Each adds a new ability to your character, from casting fireballs to summoning skeleton minions to rearranging time and space.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL MOD AND WORKSHOP SUPPORT</h2>Easily create new items, characters, encounters, quests, and more with paintable tilesets, a visual scripting editor, and other included development tools. You can also easily download other players' creations through Steam Workshop.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Exterminated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/670fd63319fc7c65e833b486cb8e99a1b98d33ac.jpg"},{"name":"Just Desserts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/0f9bdc4d7c0a1c9323b98b4e8dcdbbfc973d6d76.jpg"},{"name":"Ground Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/528d66c5fe3b381bd3091b4ad6b17381bee1aa07.jpg"},{"name":"Bagged and Tagged","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/80262eaff2be2b8a5b5d5ac157b51d14c7c79c16.jpg"},{"name":"Lit Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/a0046306d80903ebe6eafe6f350adec72644fb3d.jpg"},{"name":"Uprooted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/093389b0fa9d92145df20d981ab9cde5e38981c9.jpg"},{"name":"Hazardous Materials","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/71d34530987dfe8fb34c2d48020415216f546ce6.jpg"},{"name":"The Hard Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/8c2a5cd2ef7e4ea71830c17979597c09b0aede56.jpg"},{"name":"A Dusty Place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/a65dac90fc51193f65be876a41d53a67378a1141.jpg"},{"name":"Hallowed Be Thy Name","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1869780/52e35e88023ee349a62abcf531d0077d329935f3.jpg"}],"total":32},"ba